cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Manacá-1B, please cite the preprint below."
title: "Manacá-1B: An Open, Reproducible Brazilian-Portuguese Language Model and a Tokenizer-Aware, Paired Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Manacá-1B is an open decoder-only language model of about 1.72 billion
  parameters, trained from scratch for Brazilian Portuguese with a fully
  containerized, reproducible pipeline. This repository releases the training and
  evaluation pipeline, the raw logs, the per-example prediction vectors, and the
  corrected tokenizer, so that every number in the paper can be recomputed.
